  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **The inbox admits a tommand an endpoint sends a deferred handler of its own (Compze.Tessaging 0.14.0-alpha), within the sender's transaction:** the inbox's admissions table, `<endpoint name>_InboxDeliveryStreamAdmissions`, gets a row whose sender is the endpoint itself, created when the endpoint starts, whose lock makes the sends to the endpoint itself commit one after another.\n- **Requires exact versions of the Compze packages whose internals it uses:** Compze.Sql.Common 0.9.1-alpha (not required directly before), Compze.Sql.Sqlite 0.8.1-alpha (was 0.8.0-alpha or newer), Compze.Tessaging 0.15.0-alpha (was 0.14.0-alpha or newer). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here to exactly that version, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
